Z||000003||SLYGUY||10-12-2001||12:49 AM||||I read about it in this months Car and Driver. Fantastic car. It looks very much like a Fiero, and shares some real race heritage:mid engine.<P>It's main competition/adversary is the McClaren. They built it to (company is very strong and has NO debt!)create a new top land speed record for a production automobile.<P>It would have no problem beating this record if they would design a way to put a larger motor with perhaps 800-950rwhp. Great looking car. Almost as gorgeous as a white 88GT. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Sly<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SLYGUYSIG.jpg"> ||||reg||1
